  "html": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col col-8\"><h2>Small Parts Laminator II</h2><figure><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Small-Parts-Laminator-II-b.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div class=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n<li>Three incoming uni-tapes (45°, -45°, 90°)</li>\n<li>Ultrasonic cutter on X-Y-Theta servo stage</li>\n<li>Robot picks places plies/parts thru process</li>\n<li>Individual ply heating</li>\n<li>Stacked laminate formed to non-planar shape</li>\n<li>Formed parts placed on conveyor</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col col-4\">\n\t\t\t<nav class=\"side-nav\"><h3 class=\"widget-title\">Composite Pick and Place</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/composite-pick-and-place/laminating-complex-curvatures/\">Laminating Complex Curvatures</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/composite-pick-and-place/thermoplastic-panel-former/\">Thermoplastic Panel Former</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/composite-pick-and-place/helmet-preform-machine/\">Helmet Preform Machine</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/composite-pick-and-place/small-parts-laminator-i/\">Small Parts Laminator I</a></li><li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/composites-automation/composite-pick-and-place/small-parts-laminator-ii/\">Small Parts Laminator II</a></li><li><a href=\"/composites-automation/composite-pick-and-place/small-parts-laminator/\">Small Parts Laminator III</a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></div><h3>Machine Images</h3><div class=\"gallery\"><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Small-Parts-Laminator-II-b.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Small-Parts-Laminator-II-b-298x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"298\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><a href=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Small-Parts-Laminator-II-a.jpg\"><img src=\"/uploads/2016/07/CA-Small-Parts-Laminator-II-a-300x206.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"206\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>"
